    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai USSR - is a sharp action movie with elements of drama, you are in the role of an American spy whose task is to learn about the plans of the Soviets in a closed military town.<br></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159680/extras/33f24a638eafba1d77fba152a2ec40fb.webp?t=1738027192\" width=363 height=58 /></span><strong><br>We have for you a small but cozy raznznobrazny and filled with open world where you will find a bunch of interesting passhalok, secrets and just beautiful places.Explore an abandoned nuclear power plant or ordinary residential areas. Abandoned garages or empty store counters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore it both on your own and on a car that you can \u201crequeze\u201d from the local poor people.<br></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159680/extras/4c8d06df1b7628d30132602e0f9c78df.webp?t=1738027192\" width=293 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break through the enemies, consult the local informant and find out the plans of the councils. Perform various tasks, help the local dubious personalities and remember not to enter the toilets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159680/extras/27c1e6ede135e7e8dcb530f8d2399e05.avif?t=1738027192\" width=439 height=221 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
